lopment and creative project build","description":"Build a content portfolio and complete the creative project for your brief, test it with peers and prepare the showcase.","duration_minutes":120,"objectives":["Explain what makes a strong content portfolio (best three to five pieces, variety, results, story behind each piece)","Choose a portfolio platform (Google Drive folder, Behance, Instagram highlights, a simple website), and submit it through a restricted-access link or DIRA LEARN","Write a short case study for one piece (brief, idea, process, result, learning)","Complete the creative project to a publishable standard","Improve the project based on peer testing","Explain basic freelance terms (brief, deliverables, revisions, deadline, rate) in simple language"],"topics":[],"activities":["Project check-in","What makes a strong portfolio","Creative project production","Stretch break","Peer testing","Revise and prepare the showcase","Showcase briefing and homework"],"expected_output":"Completed creative project (video, photo set, branded designs); Content portfolio with three to five pieces, case-study notes and contact details; Completed credit and consent log; Showcase presentation draft","assessment_notes":"DRAFT (V13.2 curriculum revision, 19 Nov 2026): full lesson plan with timed segments, activities, assessment and facilitator notes. Assessment: 2 questions or tasks, checked against the expected outputs. Needs approval by programme management.","is_approved":false,"source":"curriculum_v13"}, {"id":"b46fd49d-d091-4eeb-aab7-10373005b48a","programme_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000a1","track_id":"2653cd8b-059a-4e92-a230-f8c874b397b7","week_no":4,"session_no":7,"title":"AI project build and testing","description":"Build an AI-assisted solution for a real brief, evaluate it with the AI quality checklist, test it with a real user and prepare a demonstration.","duration_minutes":120,"objectives":["Define the problem, user, AI role and success test for the project","Build a working AI-assisted solution using a documented prompt set and tools","Evaluate the solution with the AI quality checklist and fix problems","Test the solution with a real user and record their feedback","Prepare a three-minute demonstration with an AI-use disclosure"],"topics":[],"activities":["Project check-in","Designing your solution","Build","Stretch break","Evaluate and user-test","Revise and prepare the demonstration","Showcase briefing and homework"],"expected_output":"Completed project design canvas; Working AI-assisted solution with documented prompt set and user instructions; AI quality checklist and user test record; Draft three-minute demonstration","assessment_notes":"DRAFT (V13.2 curriculum revision, 19 Nov 2026): full lesson plan with timed segments, activities, assessment and facilitator notes. Assessment: 3 questions or tasks, checked against the expected outputs. Needs approval by programme management.","is_approved":false,"source":"curriculum_v13"}, {"id":"c3dcef6d-faf9-47c9-8df7-cdb847f057e2","programme_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000a1","track_id":"5b634bd2-5008-4a74-b026-dc19413903a4","week_no":2,"session_no":4,"title":"Value proposition and business model","description":"Describe customer value and map a simple business model.","duration_minutes":120,"objectives":[],"topics":["Introduction to digital marketing","Social media marketing (Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, LinkedIn)","Content planning and creation","Canva for marketing graphics","Marketing copywriting, captions and calls to action","WhatsApp Business","Digital advertising fundamentals","SEO fundamentals","Marketing analytics and measuring campaign performance","Developing a practical digital marketing strategy"],"activities":["Simplified business model canvas","Peer challenge"],"expected_output":"One-page business model","assessment_notes":"Approved by DIRA (8 Nov 2026), including the digital marketing topics.","is_approved":true,"source":"curriculum_docx + mas