. Please finish and submit your work before then. You will still be able to view your results and certificate afterwards.","is_system":true,"is_active":true,"updated_by":null,"updated_at":"2026-11-21T19:24:47.201261+03:00","created_at":"2026-11-21T19:24:47.201261+03:00"}, {"id":"5058fe1b-0c0c-4a28-af8f-eabeaa3a2c01","key":"access_changed","name":"Learning access changed","subject":"{{change_title}}","body":"Hello {{first_name}},\n\n{{change_body}}\n\nSign in to DIRA Learn for details.","is_system":true,"is_active":true,"updated_by":null,"updated_at":"2026-11-21T19:24:47.201261+03:00","created_at":"2026-11-21T19:24:47.201261+03:00"}, {"id":"633aa6c1-966d-48ce-b491-af56f13e8459","key":"application_rejected","name":"Application not successful","subject":"An update on your DIRA LEARN application","body":"Hello {{first_name}},\n\nThank you for applying to the DIRA Foundation programme and for the time you put into your application. After careful review, we are not able to offer you a place in this cohort.\n\nThis is not a judgement of your potential. You are welcome to apply again for a future cohort. If you have questions, contact us through our website.\n\nWith best wishes,\nDIRA Foundation","is_system":true,"is_active":true,"updated_by":null,"updated_at":"2026-11-21T19:24:47.001097+03:00","created_at":"2026-11-21T19:24:47.001097+03:00"}, {"id":"856c131a-9d9a-476a-a569-5be1340153d7","key":"safeguarding_alert","name":"Safeguarding alert","subject":"DIRA LEARN: {{alert_title}}","body":"Hello {{first_name}},\n\n{{alert_title}}.\n\nFor confidentiality this email contains no details. Please sign in to DIRA LEARN and open Safeguarding.\n\nDIRA Foundation","is_system":true,"is_active":true,"updated_by":null,"updated_at":"2026-11-21T19:24:47.444837+03:00","created_at":"2026-11-21T19:24:47.444837+03:00"}, {"id":"991a313b-08a4-4d60-bbc5-0f5b5de9f95a","key":"application_approved","name":"Application approved","subject":"Your DIRA LEARN application was approved","body":"Hello {{first_name}},\n\nGood news: your application to the DIRA Foundation programme has been approved. You now have participant access to DIRA LEARN.\n\nSign in to see your dashboard. Details of your cohort and schedule will follow.\n\nWelcome aboard,\nDIRA Foundation","is_system":true,"is_active":true,"updated_by":null,"updated_at":"2026-11-21T19:24:47.001097+03:00","created_at":"2026-11-21T19:24:47.001097+03:00"}, {"id":"b8b09c5b-1b4f-4290-9d88-5ff4bcea313e","key":"cohort_welcome","name":"Cohort welcome","subject":"Welcome to {{cohort_name}}","body":"Hello {{first_name}},\n\nYou are enrolled in {{cohort_name}} ({{programme_name}}). Sign in to DIRA Learn to see your schedule.","is_system":false,"is_active":true,"updated_by":null,"updated_at":"2026-11-21T19:24:46.821028+03:00","created_at":"2026-11-21T19:24:46.821028+03:00"}, {"id":"fa743547-f01b-4446-9778-4b4ba62e2d00","key":"assignment_reminder","name":"Assignment due reminder","subject":"Reminder: {{assignment_title}} is due {{due_date}}","body":"Hello {{first_name}},\n\nYour assignment \"{{assignment_title}}\" for {{cohort_name}} is due on {{due_date}}. Sign in to DIRA Learn to submit it.","is_system":true,"is_active":true,"updated_by":null,"updated_at":"2026-11-21T19:24:46.821028+03:00","created_at":"2026-11-21T19:24:46.821028+03:00"}]$dira_json$::jsonb); alter table public.email_templates enable trigger user;
